-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights and data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are included. With the default "local" embedding feature,
the ONNX Runtime library is downloaded when the crate is built and the
embedding model (intfloat/multilingual-e5-small, MIT) is downloaded on first
use into the user's cache directory, under their own licences.

The demo brain (demo/) is generated from texts that are in the public domain
in the United States and Brazil; see demo/transcendentalist/SOURCES.md. The
lab that builds it lives on the repository's `lab` branch.

